  m_text: Here in Bremerton, we're bringing you the freshest Pacific Northwest ingredients
    in every season. Ever had marionberries right off the vine? Always wanted to
    try steamed geoduck?  Our Bremerton branch has everything you desire. And, with
    our committment to local globality, you could be seeing the freshest Bremerton
    ingredients in a store near you!
